    "detailed_description": "Dictators : No Peace Countryballs is a war simulation and dictator game. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a fun,simple and some say a funny countryballs game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you like simulation games, you will love playing Dictators : No Peace. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay as a dictator of your favourite country and colonize the world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStart ruling the world : <br />\r\nIncrease your gold reserves by upgrading your production activities. <br />\r\nAlso increase your gold reserves by trading goods. <br />\r\nUse the gold reserves to upgrade your military and then Colonize.<br />\r\n <br />\r\nBecome the greatest President of your country and the greatest dictator of all time. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave fun playing Dictators : No Peace.",
